{"id":478,"flavor":[{"games":["Legends: Arceus"],"text":"A Pokémon inhabited by the soul of a woman who died bearing a grudge in the snowy mountains. Legends of Froslass placing deathly curses on misbehaving men send shivers down my spine."},{"games":["Shield"],"text":"It spits out cold air of nearly −60 degrees Fahrenheit to freeze its quarry. It brings frozen prey back to its lair and neatly lines them up."},{"games":["Sword"],"text":"After a woman met her end on a snowy mountain, her regrets lingered on. From them, this Pokémon was born. Its favorite food is frozen souls."},{"games":["Ultra Moon"],"text":"It’s said that on nights of terrible blizzards, it comes down to human settlements. If you hear it knocking at your door, do not open it!"},{"games":["Ultra Sun"],"text":"It freezes hikers who have come to climb snowy mountains and carries them back to its home. It only goes after men it thinks are handsome."},{"games":["Moon"],"text":"The soul of a woman lost on a snowy mountain possessed an icicle, becoming this Pokémon. The food it most relishes is the souls of men."},{"games":["Sun"],"text":"When it finds humans or Pokémon it likes, it freezes them and takes them to its chilly den, where they become decorations."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Y","SoulSilver","HeartGold"],"text":"Legends in snowy regions say that a woman who was lost on an icy mountain was reborn as Froslass."},{"games":["Omega Ruby","X"],"text":"It freezes foes with an icy breath nearly -60 degrees Fahrenheit. What seems to be its body is actually hollow."},{"games":["White 2","Black 2","White","Black","Platinum"],"text":"It freezes prey by blowing its -58 degrees F breath. It is said to then secretly display its prey."},{"games":["Pearl","Diamond"],"text":"It freezes foes with an icy breath nearly -60 degrees F. What seems to be its body is actually hollow."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Snow Cloak","hidden":false,"description":"Boosts the Pokémon's evasiveness in snow."},{"name":"Cursed Body","hidden":true,"description":"May disable a move that has dealt damage to the Pokémon."}],"eggGroups":["Fairy","Mineral"],"genderRate":8,"hatchCounter":20,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"medium","habitat":null,"color":"White","shape":"Arms","evolution":{"id":361,"name":"Snorunt","condition":null,"children":[{"id":362,"name":"Glalie","condition":"Lv. 42","children":[]},{"id":478,"name":"Froslass","condition":"Use Dawn Stone (female)","children":[]}]},"moves":{"game":"Scarlet / Violet","level":[[0,506],[1,29],[1,43],[1,44],[1,104],[1,181],[1,182],[1,194],[1,242],[1,310],[1,423],[15,420],[20,577],[25,196],[30,524],[35,109],[40,883],[47,261],[54,694],[61,247],[68,59]],"machine":[419,59,34,204,886,109,242,174,577,203,263,313,374,416,114,270,506,63,58,423,8,861,333,196,286,113,101,220,809,182,244,94,240,115,156,184,247,214,883,191,180,164,36,269,851,87,86,85,271,813,352,311,261],"egg":[],"tutor":[]},"cards":[{"id":"me2pt5-275","name":"Mega Froslass ex","set":"Ascended Heroes","date":"2026-01-30","rarity":"Special Illustration Rare","number":"275","artist":"Teeziro","small":"https://images.scrydex.com/pokemon/me2pt5-275/small","large":"https://images.scrydex.com/pokemon/me2pt5-275/large"},{"id":"me2pt5-47","name":"Mega Froslass ex","set":"Ascended Heroes","date":"2026-01-30","rarity":"Double Rare","number":"47","artist":"5ban Graphics","small":"https://images.scrydex.com/pokemon/me2pt5-47/small","large":"https://images.scrydex.com/pokemon/me2pt5-47/large"},{"id":"me2pt5-265","name":"Mega Froslass ex","set":"Ascended Heroes","date":"2026-01-30","rarity":"MEGA_ATTACK_RARE","number":"265","artist":"Saboteri","small":"https://images.scrydex.com/pokemon/me2pt5-265/small","large":"https://images.scrydex.com/pokemon/me2pt5-265/large"},{"id":"sv6-53","name":"Froslass","set":"Twilight Masquerade","date":"2024-05-24","rarity":"Rare","number":"53","artist":"Makura Tami","img":"sv6/53"},{"id":"sv6-174","name":"Froslass","set":"Twilight Masquerade","date":"2024-05-24","rarity":"Illustrati